WEBVTT

00:37:58.210 --> 00:38:02.053
"People are coming in on our terms
and welcomed by us,"

00:38:02.077 --> 00:38:05.241
as opposed to suddenly
huge numbers of people

00:38:05.265 --> 00:38:08.753
who don't look like you
and don't talk like you

00:38:08.777 --> 00:38:12.146
arrive and create that, sort of,
feeling of angst.

00:38:12.170 --> 00:38:15.007
Isn't it possible that
the global capitalists

00:38:15.031 --> 00:38:18.429
who just believe, "Open up everything,
make everything free," whatever,

00:38:18.453 --> 00:38:23.697
that they've been naïve about
humans' ability to adapt to change

00:38:23.721 --> 00:38:25.457
that rapid and that dramatic?

00:38:25.481 --> 00:38:28.695
DB: Well, there's clearly tensions,
but, every once in a while --

00:38:28.719 --> 00:38:32.326
this has happened to me probably six times
in the last four or five years --